<title>UK: Ceval Alimentos sets $100 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Ceval Alimentos sets $100 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Chase.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CEVAL ALIMENTOS SA</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     10.625    MATURITY  **30.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.90     PAY DATE   S10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+425 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON. SPREAD TO PUT</p>
<p>	    **CALL 30.DEC.01 AT 99.925, PUT 30.DEC.01 AT 99.90</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1-250     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  0.625</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
